flowchart LR
  U[Human question and constraints] --> W[Research workflow<br/>scope and decisive unknowns]
  W --> T[Retrieval through available tools]
  T --> E[Saved source record<br/>locator, time, status, text artifact]
  E --> M[claims.json<br/>source and citation ledger]
  D[Marked report.md<br/>claim IDs and exact text] --> M
  M --> V[validate_claims.py<br/>mechanical record checks]
  E --> V
  D --> V
  V -->|record errors| F[Correct evidence or qualify claim]
  F --> M
  V -->|prepared records| R[Separate reviewer<br/>meaning, omissions, uncertainty]
  R -->|verdicts bound to report and manifest hashes| J[review.json]
  J --> C[check]
  M --> C
  E --> C
  D --> C
  C -->|pass| O[render<br/>remove claim markers]
  C -->|fail or changed bytes| F
  O --> A[Report for reader<br/>with stated limits]

  subgraph G[Optional Codex guard when loaded, trusted and activated]
    P[PreToolUse<br/>covered-call allowance] --> L[Lead and extension ledger<br/>coordinator decisions]
    L --> S[research-scope.json<br/>closure and lead dispositions]
    S --> M
    H[Stop audit<br/>frozen snapshot and text match] --> C
    O --> H
  end
  W -. guard mode .-> P
  H -. cleared or NOT CLEARED<br/>cannot retract generated text .-> A

  classDef human fill:#102a3d,stroke:#83d5f4,color:#f8fcff
  classDef evidence fill:#132f43,stroke:#679bb2,color:#f8fcff
  classDef check fill:#123d42,stroke:#63dfcf,color:#f8fcff
  classDef caveat fill:#44302e,stroke:#ffae78,color:#f8fcff
  class U,R,A human
  class T,E,M,D,J,S evidence
  class V,C,O,P,L,H check
  class F caveat
